stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Loading: open subject
  Loading --> Success: validated findings
  Loading --> Empty: missing or empty research
  Loading --> Refused: malformed or refused read
  Refused --> Loading: explicit retry
  Success --> Selected: select exact kind locally
  Selected --> Success: clear selection
  Selected --> Selected: same subject refresh keeps available kind
  Selected --> Success: refreshed kind disappears
  Success --> Loading: replace subject and reset
  Loading --> Idle: close retires late completion
  Success --> Idle: close
  Selected --> Idle: auth retirement or suspension
  Loading --> Disposed: dispose retires late completion
  Success --> Disposed: dispose
  Disposed --> Disposed: stale completion ignored
